{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4pptjWvnKeCzpHx6gH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door. Iron-banded oak, ancient and unyielding.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center. Tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye, waiting.*\n\n*You say \"key.\"*\n\n*I do nothing. I am a door. I do not provide keys. I accept them.*\n\n*The keyhole stares back at you, patient as centuries. A faint draft breathes through it from whatever lies beyond — cold, carrying a scent like old stone and possibility.*\n\n*Insert the key, or do not. I will be here either way.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":144,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}